<section class="ac-advancement ac-shell">
  <header class="ac-wizard-header"><div><span class="ac-kicker">DHF ADVANCEMENT // EXISTING CHARACTER</span><h1>Level Up: {{actor.name}}</h1><p>Spend Stack Points on the character you already have. No new Actor, new sleeve or resource reset is created.</p></div><div class="ac-advance-balance"><strong>{{sp}}</strong><span>AVAILABLE SP</span></div></header>
  <nav class="ac-advance-tabs" aria-label="Advancement sections">{{#each sections}}<button type="button" data-action="setSection" data-section="{{id}}" class="{{#if active}}active{{/if}}">{{label}}</button>{{/each}}<button type="button" data-action="refresh" title="Refresh this character"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i></button></nav>
  <div class="ac-advance-stage">
    {{#if isSkills}}<div class="ac-step-heading"><h2>Improve Skills</h2><p>Each purchase advances one Skill Level. A smaller die is better. Review the cost before confirming.</p></div><div class="ac-advance-list">{{#each skills}}<article class="ac-advance-row"><div><strong>{{name}}</strong><small>Level {{level}} / d{{die}}{{#if nextDie}} to d{{nextDie}}{{/if}}</small>{{#unless available}}<small class="ac-muted">{{explanation}}</small>{{/unless}}</div><button type="button" data-action="buySkill" data-item-id="{{id}}" {{#unless available}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#if nextCost}}Improve - {{nextCost}} SP{{else}}Maximum{{/if}}</button></article>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
    {{#if isAttributes}}<div class="ac-step-heading"><h2>Improve Attributes</h2><p>Each SP buys one d4 of increase. Physical gains belong to the active sleeve; mental gains stay with the DHF. Gains stop at the shown cap.</p></div><div class="ac-advance-list">{{#each attributes}}<article class="ac-advance-row" data-attribute-row><div><strong>{{name}}: {{value}} / {{cap}}</strong><small>{{#if physical}}Active sleeve{{else}}Persistent DHF{{/if}}</small>{{#unless available}}<small>{{explanation}}</small>{{/unless}}</div><label>SP <input type="number" name="attributeSP" min="1" max="{{@root.sp}}" value="1" step="1" aria-label="Stack Points for {{name}}"></label><button type="button" data-action="buyAttribute" data-attribute="{{key}}" {{#unless available}}disabled{{/unless}}>Review Increase</button></article>{{/each}}</div><div class="ac-callout">Cap-changing Traits need an explicit GM-recorded cap override; this wizard does not infer bonuses from prose. Excess rolled points are lost. Existing Health and Ego are not refilled.</div>{{/if}}
    {{#if isSpecialisations}}<div class="ac-step-heading"><h2>Learn a Specialisation</h2><p>Costs increase with the number already recorded for the selected Skill: 15, 20, 25, then 30 SP. Duplicate entries are rejected.</p></div><article class="ac-panel"><div class="ac-field-grid one"><label><span>Skill</span><select name="specialisationSkill">{{#each skills}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label><span>Specialisation name</span><input name="specialisationName" maxlength="100" placeholder="Choose a focused, table-approved specialisation"></label><label><span>Published untrained Difficulty</span><input type="number" name="missingDifficulty" min="0" step="1" value="0"></label></div><p class="ac-muted">Use the entry's printed Difficulty, or zero when it does not specify one. The confirmation shows the actual cost for this character.</p><button type="button" data-action="buySpecialisation" class="ac-primary-action">Review Specialisation</button></article>{{/if}}
    {{#if isTraits}}<div class="ac-step-heading"><h2>Learn Traits</h2><p>Costs and lower-tier prerequisites use the installed rules engine. A new branch includes its unlock cost. Existing package Traits count as owned.</p></div>
      <div class="ac-advance-filters"><label>Find a Trait <input name="traitSearch" type="search" placeholder="Name, tree or branch"></label>{{#if isCivilian}}<label>Civilian tree Commonality <select name="commonality"><option value="common">Common</option><option value="uncommon">Uncommon</option><option value="anomaly">Anomaly</option></select></label><label class="ac-check-field"><input type="checkbox" name="confirmCommonality"> I confirm this tree's Commonality with the GM.</label>{{/if}}</div>
      <div class="ac-callout">Trait purchases create their records; prose effects and choice-based benefits are not automatically inferred. Civilian prices are estimates until Commonality is confirmed. GM-set tree overrides take priority.</div>
      <div class="ac-advance-list">{{#each traits}}<article class="ac-advance-row ac-advance-trait" data-trait-search="{{name}} {{tree}} {{branch}}"><div><strong>{{name}}</strong><small>{{tree}} / {{branch}} / Tier {{tier}} / {{commonality}}</small><details><summary>Effect and requirements</summary><p>{{effect}}</p>{{#unless available}}<p>{{explanation}}</p>{{/unless}}</details></div><button type="button" data-action="buyTrait" data-catalog-id="{{id}}" {{#unless available}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#if available}}Review - {{cost}} SP{{else}}Unavailable{{/if}}</button></article>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
    {{#if isHistory}}<div class="ac-step-heading"><h2>Advancement History</h2><p>Purchases made through this wizard or the creator's Level Up step are recorded here. Earlier manual edits are not retroactively invented.</p></div>{{#each history}}<article class="ac-panel ac-advance-history"><h3>{{when}} - {{spent}} SP</h3><p>Balance: {{before}} to {{after}} SP. {{reason}}</p><ul>{{#each steps}}<li>{{label}}{{#if hasRoll}}. Rolled {{rolled}}; actual gain {{gain}}; {{from}} to {{to}}.{{/if}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></article>{{else}}<p class="ac-muted">No recorded advancement purchases yet.</p>{{/each}}{{/if}}
  </div>
  <footer class="ac-advance-footer"><label>Record a reason <input name="advancementReason" maxlength="500" placeholder="Optional session or milestone note"></label><span>SP costs are confirmed before anything changes.</span></footer>
</section>
